Drug oracle hooks for JA2 Stracciatella (Strategy First SFI-SCLA), ja2-node 2026-11-04. See LICENSE (SFI-SCLA).
Appends OracleUpdateRegenCounters to Hourly_Update.cc, so the drug probes can run the static UpdateRegenCounters (the
six-hourly decrement of bRegenBoostersUsedToday) alone. No behaviour change. Applied by tools/oracle/build.sh after 0025.

--- a/src/game/Strategic/Hourly_Update.cc
+++ b/src/game/Strategic/Hourly_Update.cc
@@ -337,3 +337,8 @@
 {
 	HourlyCheckIfSlayAloneSoHeCanLeave();
 }
+
+void OracleUpdateRegenCounters()
+{
+	UpdateRegenCounters();
+}
